draft: true
id: E552
title: CMake shared option and exported target mapping for independent OHOS libraries
scope: conan cmake ohos shared static target mapping
symptoms: Conan package links fail when BUILD_SHARED_LIBS and exported target names are assumed from the recipe
root_cause: Upstream CMake may expose an interface alias whose implementation target and archive name differ from the package metadata
repair: Bind shared to BUILD_SHARED_LIBS, read back generated targets and archive names, and set cpp_info target and libs from observed output
verification: Conan create and consumer compile/link passed for pugixml 1.16 on OHOS/arm64
boundaries: Applies to CMake libraries with explicit install/export rules; does not replace target runtime validation
